<title>USA: Security Capital holders approve deal.</title>
<headline>Security Capital holders approve deal.</headline>
<dateline>MILWAUKEE 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Security Capital Corp said Thursday that its shareholders at a special meeting have approved its pending acquisition by Marshall &amp; Ilsley Corp .</p>
<p>All of the required federal and state regulatory approvals have been obtained and, subject to the satisfaction of certain conditions, the companies expect the transaction will be completed on or about October 1, 1997.</p>
<p>In mid-March, Marshall &amp; Ilsley agreed to acquire Security Capital in a $945 million stock and cash deal.  Marshall &amp; Ilsley has about $14.8 billion in assets and Security Capital has about $3.7 billion in assets.</p>
<p>			((Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8787))</p>
</text>
